##### AquaGreen  
*solo / duo* 

A 3 L raceway with adjustable swirl-flow supports floating plants or dense micro-algae. A harvest mesh roller compresses biomass while spent medium auto-remineralises.

###### Crop Categories & Cultivars  
Aquatic plants & algae – all 12 Balcony items  

